# Coding standards

Full list: `ai/CODING_RULES.md`. Essentials:

- Backend: feature package `controller -> service -> repository`; record DTOs with Bean Validation; thin
  controllers; errors via `BadRequestException` / `ConflictException` / `NotFoundException` /
  `FieldValidationException`; lists via `Specification` + `PageRequests.of(..., SORTABLE)`.
- Batch related counts (no N+1); `@Transactional` writes with `version` checks; product writes enqueue
  `VectorSyncOutbox` events in the same transaction.
- Frontend: API via `src/api/endpoints.ts`; types in `src/api/types.ts`; react-hook-form + zod; reuse
  `src/components/ui/*`; filters in URL params; setState only in promise callbacks inside effects.
- Never modify unrelated modules; never put secrets in code.
